// The dashed links the map draws over straits an army can march across (map_data/crossings,
// Scripts/gfx/GlobeStraitCrossings.cs): pale stone for a bridge, a tunnel or a causeway, pale
// blue for a ferry, amber where an enemy fleet commands the water and red where it has
// stopped the ferry.
//
// This switches the drawing only. A mod that wants the crossings themselves gone says so in
// map_data/crossings, entry by entry, with { "open": false }.
{
  "strait_crossings": true
}
